    "1. 本凭证为交易记录，非增值税发票，不可作为税务抵扣凭证。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. This receipt records a transaction. It is not a VAT invoice and cannot be used for tax deduction."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. 本凭证为交易记录，非增值税发票，不可作为税务抵扣凭证。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2. 请当面验机；非人为故障自签收之日起 7 日内协商处理，人为损坏不在范围内。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2. Please inspect the machine on receipt. Non-accidental faults are handled within 7 days of acceptance; accidental damage is excluded."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2. 请当面验机；非人为故障自签收之日起 7 日内协商处理，人为损坏不在范围内。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2. 请当面验机；非人为故障自签收之日起 \\(document.warrantyDays) 日内协商处理，人为损坏不在范围内。": {
