    "建议价 = 总进价 ÷ (1 − 目标毛利率)，库龄超过 \\(PricingAdvice.markdownStartDays) 天后每满一周再降 \\(PricingAdvice.markdownPerWeek)%，最多降 \\(PricingAdvice.maxMarkdownPercent)%，且不低于总进价。详情页会按这条规则给出建议价，可一键采用。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Suggested price = landed cost ÷ (1 − target margin), then %lld%% off for every full week past %lld days, capped at %lld%% and never below landed cost. The details panel applies this rule and the price can be adopted in one click."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "建议价 = 总进价 ÷ (1 − 目标毛利率)，库龄超过 \\(PricingAdvice.markdownStartDays) 天后每满一周再降 \\(PricingAdvice.markdownPerWeek)%，最多降 \\(PricingAdvice.maxMarkdownPercent)%，且不低于总进价。详情页会按这条规则给出建议价，可一键采用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
