    "所有记录只存在这台电脑的沙盒里。选一个文件夹，App 每天首次启动时自动写一份快照过去，误删或换机时才有得恢复。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every record lives only inside this Mac's sandbox. Choose a folder and a snapshot is written there each day, so a mistake or a new machine is recoverable."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有记录只存在这台电脑的沙盒里。选一个文件夹，App 每天首次启动时自动写一份快照过去，误删或换机时才有得恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
