            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这一批还没有机器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这三条决定「待办」里出现哪些提醒。口径固定写死，是为了让列表、待办、统计三处永远一致——同一台机器不该有两个超期标准。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These three thresholds decide which to-dos appear. They are fixed so the list, the to-dos and the stats always agree — one machine should not have two definitions of overdue."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这三条决定「待办」里出现哪些提醒。口径固定写死，是为了让列表、待办、统计三处永远一致——同一台机器不该有两个超期标准。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这三项会原样印在销售凭证顶部。留空也能开单，凭证上就不显示对应的行。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These print unchanged at the top of the receipt. Leaving them blank is fine; the lines are then omitted."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这三项会原样印在销售凭证顶部。留空也能开单，凭证上就不显示对应的行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
