    "首行须为表头，至少包含「序列号」「型号」。可先导出一份 CSV 作为模板。「进价」为必填列；其余金额列留空按 0 处理，汇率留空按 1 处理。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The first row must be a header with at least Serial number and Model. Export a CSV first to get a template. Cost is required; other amount columns default to 0 and the exchange rate to 1."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首行须为表头，至少包含「序列号」「型号」。可先导出一份 CSV 作为模板。「进价」为必填列；其余金额列留空按 0 处理，汇率留空按 1 处理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
